                                "text": "The Newfoundland dog has webfeet."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "337d7662-b0c2-34d3-b2a4-78d05171910f",
                        "entry_id": "a715e1e9-f281-35ae-8bce-1372430cd8b7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A web-footed animal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3933be96-5866-406c-918c-d1b57a3cfdab",
                                "sense_id": "337d7662-b0c2-34d3-b2a4-78d05171910f",
                                "text": "The Newfoundland dog is a webfoot."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4fc8dd76-da94-4d6b-819a-5a4df601fab1",
                                "sense_id": "337d7662-b0c2-34d3-b2a4-78d05171910f",
                                "text": "Etta smiled, remembering Cal Albatross back then, patiently helping the webfoots perfect their diving and swimming skills. She watched him stretch his long supple wings in the afternoon sunlight […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8cbf93d5-f51e-4d8e-8a12-a202631c582f",
